4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=n-QpXJzndYAQ7kNvwHj8aBu&_nc_oc=AdpJeYCXhqzOUgCCtQNuAOguNLNA71iDScTYMRHppKpUpsdSVImRrgQzwPNkFA5GVs8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af90QhdlKlPJlLmmiRU07Fxpvl-HuXcRd1ufpb5QILC8SQ&oe=6A3FCA54"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4x_d5hJzNp0Q7kNvwFVi29E&_nc_oc=AdoJyucUu67_TirvtOHOwGrT11yOgaEnufDOy470UwglOV5LlHJduHzRGDktneEEYUU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af98dincZ50xKIv2Heq2iSjasSBcie0hbMG7u_AVkT7YOg&oe=6A3FCF32"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VkerRt8qCMUQ7kNvwH2r-6n&_nc_oc=AdqJ296ZcBKn702Ygw9HG9OhzvQe9D3DWCLw8uytj8RC5-9EZ0nvYOkHAw1JlL6B8Ao&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-IIL203F35EO2AScs2EHyy4z7TNALnj9qKChRDpGFb3A&oe=6A3FDCD5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p